    "Every 5 minutes, lasting about a minute, for an hour — the widely used rule. Providers differ; the chip on the timer sets yours. When your pattern truly meets it, the app says so and suggests the call.": {
      "comment": "How It Works lesson body: the guideline rule",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle 5 Minuten, etwa eine Minute lang, eine Stunde lang — die verbreitetste Regel. Fachleute raten unterschiedlich; das Feld auf der Uhr setzt deine. Wenn dein Muster sie wirklich erfüllt, sagt die App es und schlägt den Anruf vor."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every 5 minutes, lasting about a minute, for an hour — the widely used rule. Providers differ; the chip on the timer sets yours. When your pattern truly meets it, the app says so and suggests the call."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada 5 minutos, de alrededor de un minuto, durante una hora — la regla más usada. Los profesionales difieren; la ficha del cronómetro fija la tuya. Cuando tu patrón realmente la cumpla, la app lo dice y sugiere la llamada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toutes les 5 minutes, d’environ une minute, pendant une heure — la règle la plus répandue. Les professionnels diffèrent ; la pastille du chronomètre fixe la vôtre. Quand votre rythme y correspond vraiment, l’app le dit et suggère l’appel."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni 5 minuti, di circa un minuto, per un’ora — la regola più diffusa. I professionisti differiscono; la targhetta sul cronometro imposta la tua. Quando il tuo ritmo la soddisfa davvero, l’app lo dice e suggerisce la chiamata."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5分ごと、1回およそ1分、1時間続く — 広く使われる目安です。医療者によって違います。計測画面のタグであなたの目安を設定します。本当に満たしたとき、アプリがそう伝え、連絡を勧めます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5분마다, 한 번에 약 1분, 한 시간 동안 — 널리 쓰이는 기준이에요. 의료진마다 다르며, 측정 화면의 표시로 내 기준을 정합니다. 정말로 충족했을 때 앱이 알려주고 연락을 권해요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A cada 5 minutos, com cerca de um minuto, por uma hora — a regra mais usada. Os profissionais divergem; a etiqueta no cronômetro define a sua. Quando seu padrão realmente atender a ela, o app avisa e sugere a ligação."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每 5 分钟一次，每次约一分钟，持续一小时 — 这是被广泛使用的标准。医护人员的建议不同；计时页上的标签设定你的那一个。当你的间隔真正达到时，应用会说明并建议打电话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every contraction you time appears here with its duration and the interval since the one before.": {
      "comment": "History screen empty-state caption",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Wehe, die du misst, erscheint hier mit ihrer Dauer und dem Abstand zur vorherigen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every contraction you time appears here with its duration and the interval since the one before."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada contracción que cronometras aparece aquí con su duración y el intervalo desde la anterior."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque contraction que vous chronométrez apparaît ici avec sa durée et l’intervalle depuis la précédente."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni contrazione che cronometri compare qui con la sua durata e l’intervallo dalla precedente."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "計測した陣痛は、長さと前回からの間隔とともにここに並びます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "측정한 모든 진통이 길이와 이전 진통에서의 간격과 함께 여기에 나타나요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada contração que você marca aparece aqui com sua duração e o intervalo desde a anterior."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你计时的每一次宫缩都会出现在这里，附带时长和距上一次的间隔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
