    "Over three minutes. That usually means a missed end tap. Ending it now sets it aside from the averages.": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver value for the running-long contraction button, spoken form of the on-screen caption",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Über drei Minuten. Das heißt meist, dass ein Endtipp fehlt. Sie jetzt zu beenden stellt sie neben die Mittelwerte."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Over three minutes. That usually means a missed end tap. Ending it now sets it aside from the averages."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Más de tres minutos. Eso suele significar un toque de fin que no se dio. Terminarla ahora la aparta de los promedios."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus de trois minutes. Cela signifie souvent qu’un appui de fin a été oublié. La terminer maintenant la met à part des moyennes."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oltre tre minuti. Di solito significa che è mancato il tocco di fine. Terminarla adesso la mette da parte rispetto alle medie."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3分を超えています。多くは終了のタップが抜けた場合です。ここで終了すると平均からは外れます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3분이 넘었어요. 대개 종료를 누르지 않은 경우예요. 지금 종료하면 평균에서는 빠집니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mais de três minutos. Isso geralmente significa que faltou o toque de fim. Encerrá-la agora a deixa de fora das médias."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超过三分钟。这通常表示漏点了结束。现在结束会把它排除在平均之外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
