    "Providers instruct differently — second babies, distance to the hospital, and your history all move this. If yours gave you a rule, set it here and follow theirs.": {
      "comment": "Guidance screen: explains why the app offers more than one guideline rule to choose from",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fachleute raten unterschiedlich — ein zweites Kind, die Entfernung zur Klinik und deine Vorgeschichte verschieben das alles. Wenn du eine Regel bekommen hast, trag sie hier ein und halte dich an ihre."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Providers instruct differently — second babies, distance to the hospital, and your history all move this. If yours gave you a rule, set it here and follow theirs."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada profesional indica algo distinto — un segundo bebé, la distancia al hospital y tu historia mueven esto. Si el tuyo te dio una regla, ponla aquí y sigue la suya."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque professionnel donne des consignes différentes — un deuxième bébé, la distance jusqu’à la maternité et vos antécédents changent tout cela. Si le vôtre vous a donné une règle, indiquez-la ici et suivez la sienne."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I professionisti danno indicazioni diverse — un secondo figlio, la distanza dall’ospedale e la tua storia spostano tutto questo. Se ti è stata data una regola, impostala qui e segui la loro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "医療者によって指示は違います — 二人目かどうか、産院までの距離、これまでの経過で変わります。あなたが受けた指示があれば、ここに設定してそちらに従ってください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "의료진마다 안내가 달라요 — 둘째인지, 병원까지의 거리, 그동안의 경과에 따라 달라집니다. 받은 기준이 있다면 여기에 설정하고 그쪽을 따르세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada profissional orienta de um jeito — um segundo bebê, a distância até a maternidade e o seu histórico mudam tudo isso. Se o seu deu uma regra, coloque-a aqui e siga a dele."
