    "That is closer together than the %@ guideline asks, before the hour it also asks for. Calling your provider now is reasonable — their instructions come first.": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver: verdict banner, fast-met shape, spoken form of the guideline sentence\nverdict banner, fast-met shape: states the pattern is stronger than the guideline on frequency and duration, ahead of the sustained hour, and defers to the provider",
      "generatesSymbol": false,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist enger, als die %@-Regel verlangt, und vor der Stunde, die sie ebenfalls verlangt. Jetzt deine Hebamme oder Ärztin anzurufen ist vernünftig — ihre Anweisungen gelten zuerst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That is closer together than the %@ guideline asks, before the hour it also asks for. Calling your provider now is reasonable — their instructions come first."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso es más junto de lo que pide la pauta %@, antes de la hora que también pide. Llamar a tu profesional ahora es razonable — sus indicaciones van primero."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C’est plus rapproché que ce que demande la règle %@, avant l’heure qu’elle demande aussi. Appeler votre professionnel de santé maintenant est raisonnable — ses consignes passent avant."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono più ravvicinate di quanto chieda la regola %@, prima dell’ora che chiede anch’essa. Chiamare ora la tua ostetrica o il tuo medico è ragionevole — le loro indicazioni vengono prima."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@の目安が求めるより間隔が短く、目安が求める1時間より前の段階です。今、助産師さんや医師に連絡するのは妥当です — その指示が最優先です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 기준이 요구하는 것보다 간격이 짧고, 기준이 함께 요구하는 한 시간에는 이르지 않았어요. 지금 담당 의료진에게 연락하는 것이 적절해요 — 그쪽 지시가 우선입니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso está mais próximo do que a regra %@ pede, antes da hora que ela também pede. Ligar agora para sua obstetra ou seu médico é razoável — as orientações deles vêm primeiro."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这比 %@ 标准要求的更密，而且还没到它同样要求的一小时。现在联系你的助产士或医生是合理的 — 他们的指示优先。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That meets the %@ guideline many providers use. Calling your provider now is reasonable — their instructions come first.": {
      "comment": "VoiceOver: verdict banner, met shape, spoken form of the guideline-met sentence\nverdict banner, met shape: states the guideline is met and defers to the provider",
