        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録は上から下へ読みます"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "기록은 위에서 아래로 읽어요"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A linha do tempo se lê de cima para baixo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "记录自上而下阅读"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are the records already marked CHECK — a stop-tap missed by more than three minutes, or a tap under twenty seconds. Timed contractions are not touched, and Undo puts them all back.": {
      "comment": "message of the flagged-sweep confirmation, naming what is removed, what survives, and that the whole sweep is one undo",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das sind die Einträge, die bereits mit PRÜFEN markiert sind — ein um mehr als drei Minuten verpasster Stopp-Tipp oder ein Tipp unter zwanzig Sekunden. Gemessene Wehen bleiben unberührt, und Widerrufen holt alle zurück."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are the records already marked CHECK — a stop-tap missed by more than three minutes, or a tap under twenty seconds. Timed contractions are not touched, and Undo puts them all back."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son los registros ya marcados con REVISAR — un toque de fin que se pasó más de tres minutos, o un toque de menos de veinte segundos. Las contracciones cronometradas no se tocan, y Deshacer las devuelve todas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce sont les enregistrements déjà marqués À VÉRIFIER — un appui de fin manqué de plus de trois minutes, ou un appui de moins de vingt secondes. Les contractions chronométrées ne sont pas touchées, et Annuler l’action les restaure toutes."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono i record già contrassegnati con DA CONTROLLARE — un tocco di fine mancato di oltre tre minuti, o un tocco sotto i venti secondi. Le contrazioni cronometrate non vengono toccate, e Annulla azione le riporta tutte indietro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「要確認」が付いている記録です — 終了のタップが3分以上遅れたもの、または20秒未満のタップです。計測できた陣痛はそのまま残り、「取り消す」ですべて戻せます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "‘확인’ 표시가 붙은 기록이에요 — 종료 탭이 3분 넘게 늦었거나, 20초 미만인 탭입니다. 제대로 측정된 진통은 그대로 남고, 실행 취소로 모두 되돌릴 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "São os registros já marcados com CONFERIR — um toque de fim perdido por mais de três minutos, ou um toque com menos de vinte segundos. As contrações marcadas não são afetadas, e Desfazer traz todas de volta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些是已标记“待核对”的记录 — 结束轻点晚了三分钟以上，或不足二十秒的轻点。已计时的宫缩不受影响，撤销可以把它们全部恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These averages cover the whole stretch. The timer's own figures cover the last hour, so they can differ while contractions are getting closer together.": {
      "comment": "Footnote under the call script naming which window its averages cover, and why the timer screen may show a different figure (decision 0047)",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Durchschnitte gelten für die ganze Serie. Die Zahlen des Timers gelten für die letzte Stunde, sie können sich also unterscheiden, während die Wehen enger werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These averages cover the whole stretch. The timer's own figures cover the last hour, so they can differ while contractions are getting closer together."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos promedios cubren toda la racha. Las cifras del cronómetro cubren la última hora, así que pueden diferir mientras las contracciones se van juntando."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces moyennes portent sur toute la série. Les chiffres du chronomètre portent sur la dernière heure, ils peuvent donc différer pendant que les contractions se rapprochent."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queste medie riguardano tutta la serie. I numeri del timer riguardano l’ultima ora, quindi possono differire mentre le contrazioni si avvicinano."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これらの平均は一連の全体を対象としています。タイマー画面の数字はこの1時間を対象とするため、間隔が短くなっている間は数字が食い違うことがあります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 평균은 진통 전체를 대상으로 해요. 타이머 화면의 숫자는 최근 한 시간을 대상으로 하기 때문에, 간격이 좁아지는 동안에는 서로 다를 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas médias cobrem a série inteira. Os números do cronômetro cobrem a última hora, então podem diferir enquanto as contrações vão ficando mais próximas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些平均值覆盖整一阵。计时页面的数字覆盖最近一小时，所以在宫缩越来越密时两者可能不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thirty seconds — and it waits under the question mark up top whenever you want it back.": {
      "comment": "How It Works sheet's opening caption. \"Question mark\" names the toolbar's question-mark-circle icon in words, not the bare glyph, so a half-attentive first read can't mistake it for a typo or a broken token.",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dreißig Sekunden — und es wartet oben unter dem Fragezeichen, wann immer du es wiederhaben willst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thirty seconds — and it waits under the question mark up top whenever you want it back."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Treinta segundos — y espera bajo el signo de interrogación de arriba cuando lo quieras de vuelta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trente secondes — et cela vous attend sous le point d’interrogation en haut dès que vous le voulez."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trenta secondi — e resta sotto il punto interrogativo in alto ogni volta che lo rivuoi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30秒で読めます — 見たくなったら上のはてなマークからいつでも開けます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30초면 읽어요 — 다시 보고 싶으면 위쪽 물음표 아래에 늘 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trinta segundos — e fica esperando sob o ponto de interrogação lá em cima sempre que você quiser de volta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三十秒就能读完 — 想再看时，它一直在上方的问号里等着。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes every contraction on this phone. There is no undo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das löscht alle Wehen auf diesem Telefon. Es gibt kein Zurück."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes every contraction on this phone. There is no undo."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina todas las contracciones de este teléfono. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime toutes les contractions de ce téléphone. Il n’y a pas de retour en arrière."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo elimina tutte le contrazioni su questo telefono. Non si può annullare."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この端末にあるすべての陣痛の記録を削除します。取り消しはできません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이 기기의 모든 진통 기록을 지웁니다. 되돌릴 수 없어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso exclui todas as contrações neste telefone. Não há como desfazer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除这部手机上的所有宫缩记录。无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
